; amicradle-ci T3, the lab tier: a real boot of the open ROM (ac090-boot, openrom-min), with
; T2's outputs in SYS:Test/. Version reads each built library and class from its file, so a
; file that is missing, isn't a library or has no version string ends the script with RC 20.
; MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team.
Version SYS:Test/library/libs/datatypes.library FULL
Version SYS:Test/library/libs/opendatatypes.library
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/picture.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/ilbm.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/sound.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/8svx.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/text.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/ascii.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/animation.datatype
Version SYS:Test/library/datatypes/anim.datatype
